=== PE 884: Removing the Joker from the Game ===

This problem models a card game where the joker can be
used once and then removed from play.

=== Scenario analysis ===
Case 1: Joker never used → standard coupon collector
Case 2: Joker used immediately → removes 1 needed card
Case 3: Strategic joker use → optimal stopping problem

=== Small deck simulations ===
Deck size | Target | E[no joker] | E[with joker] | E[joker removed]
----------|--------|-------------|---------------|----------------
        5 |      1 |           5 |             9 |              7
        5 |      2 |   500000011 |            11 |      250000011
